  "objective": "Audit github.com/MirakoolDev/basketoor at commit b14b3cc4facaa197c319db2ed6596f537b7eebd1. Scope: contracts/src/Basketoor.sol and contracts/src/adapters/AerodromeCLAdapter.sol (mocks, scripts, keeper and web are out of scope). Read contracts/AUDIT.md first: it has the roles, intended invariants and known limitations. Look hardest at: (1) escrow and ERC-4626 savings-vault accounting: principal vs idle vs shares, yield fee on withdraw/cancel, and whether the contract's loose USDC can drift from zero; (2) updatePlan resizing the budget (pull vs refund) and fee snapshots per plan; (3) executeDue/executeMany: Chainlink staleness and price bounds, the minOut derivation for 8-decimal stock tokens vs 18-decimal crypto, skipped legs, and fees charged only on USDC actually spent; (4) AerodromeCLAdapter: the uniswapV3SwapCallback can only be paid by the active pool (transient storage), partial fills, and the sqrt price limits; (5) owner powers (adapter, feeds, vault) and whether a plan owner can always cancel and exit without the keeper or owner.",
